sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Decision engine
  participant G as Risk gateway
  participant A as Adapter or simulator
  participant J as Journal
  D->>G: order intent
  G->>G: per-order, position, heat, rate, regime
  alt pass
    G->>A: submit, idempotent client id
    A-->>G: ack or fill report
  else refuse
    G-->>D: refusal envelope, quoted values
  end
  G->>J: verdict journaled always
